# Keep the AppImage Docker build context small. The image build only needs the
# package source plus packaging metadata (see release-tooling/appimage/Dockerfile,
# which COPYies requirements_full_linux.txt). Everything below is irrelevant to
# the build and would otherwise be uploaded as build context on every run --
# notably releases/, which holds large prebuilt AppImages.
.git
.github
releases/
snap/
docs/
tests/
example-script/
*.egg-info/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
build/
dist/
*.AppImage
